            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An article of footwear comprising an upper and a sole structure attached to the upper. The sole structure includes a fluid-filled chamber formed from one of a translucent material and a transparent material. The article of footwear further includes an insole disposed within the upper and having a plurality of perforations formed through a thickness thereof, wherein the sole structure is visible at an opening of the upper via the plurality of perforations.</p>
            </abstract>
